A place where you can ask a question about the Shannon entropy of a

*language*, a concept that regularily generates scholarly research

papers, without generating a discussion?  I would very much hope

that no such place exists; that would be a sad and boring place.


I'm sure it would be. On the other hand, I started this topic, and I'd very 
much appreciate if I wasn't the one to maintain it if such a discussion 
begins... I'd rather a real scientist (or as close to that) to have his/her 
name on the topic. And I'm no scientist.
Also, I just realized that however fluent you (not thee) might be in Lojban, 
it'll need people a bit more used to it to do Shannon entropy...

Have a great day!

-- 
